### Global CSS

To customize the Breadcrumbs component classes, you can use the `@layer components` directive.
[Learn more](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/adding-custom-styles#adding-component-classes).

```css
@layer components {
  .breadcrumbs {
    @apply gap-4 text-lg;
  }

  .breadcrumbs__link {
    @apply font-semibold;
  }

  .breadcrumbs__separator {
    @apply text-blue-500;
  }
}
```

